TI  - [Prevention, diagnosis and treatment of necrotising enterocolitis in newborns less than 32 weeks at birth in Spain].
AU  - Zozaya, Carlos
AU  - Avila-Alvarez, Alejandro
AU  - Somoza Argibay, Iván
AU  - García-Muñoz Rodrigo, Fermín
AU  - Oikonomopoulou, Niki
JO  - Anales de pediatria
